    <author initials="J." surname="Li" fullname="Jinming Li">
      <organization>China Mobile</organization>
    </author>
    <date day="29" month="October" year="2026"/>
    <abstract>
      <t>This document specifies extensions for PCEP to carry a Path Rate
   (PRate), enabling a PCE to compute and distribute the maximum
   sustainable rate for an end-to-end path.  A new METRIC type and a new
   objective function are defined.</t>
    </abstract>
  </front>
